<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Gate</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 35)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast gate &lt;someone&gt;
</pre>
<p>Opens a portal and pulls a person or creature from anywhere in the world to 
you, in a flash of light: the stronger brother of minor gate, for it can 
summon someone of any level, even far above your own. It doesn't work when 
one of you stands where magic can't reach. Arriving, the one you summon may 
well attack you, and the effort leaves you slow for a couple of rounds.
</p><p>The spell may fail. If it does, the one you tried to summon knows it. Someone 
in a fight is harder to pull away. And it can tear a rift in the powers of 
magic instead: about one cast in twenty, and more often the stronger the one 
you summon is than you. Then all your mana is gone, and something else may 
come through.
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Minor Gate</a>
